The canonical text must be downloaded rather than transcribed, so that the
legal wording is byte-exact:

    curl -o LICENSE https://raw.githubusercontent.com/polyformproject/polyform-licenses/1.0.0/PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0.md

Then insert the following line near the top of the downloaded file, directly
under the title, as the licence's "Notices" section requires:

    Required Notice: Copyright Soheil Kooklan (https://github.com/soheilkooklan)

